# Architecture docs lens

When editing C4 or ADRs:

1. ADRs are decisions; C4 is structure — C4 cites ADR IDs.
2. Do not invent containers without an ADR (or mark Proposed + open ADR).
3. Read `docs/adr/README.md` and `docs/standards/c4-standard.md`.
4. Cross-check polyglot ownership in `docs/DOMAIN_MAP.md` nests table.
